   "source": [
    "## Dorado Multi-Source Release Workflow (Unstructured Delft3DFM)\n",
    "\n",
    "This is a generalized version of the spillway-release workflow. Instead of one\n",
    "hard-coded release line fed by one particle series, it releases particles from\n",
    "**any number of named sources** (e.g. a diversion/spillway plus one or more\n",
    "tributaries), each with:\n",
    "\n",
    "- its own **location** on the grid, specified as a line, point(s), a mask, or lat/lon, and\n",
    "- its own **release schedule**, which can be a pre-made particle CSV, a discharge\n",
    "  CSV that is converted to particles, or a **placeholder constant rate** for a\n",
    "  source whose discharge you do not know yet.\n",
    "\n",
    "All sources are aligned onto a shared daily calendar (a source contributes zero\n",
    "particles on days it is inactive), distributed across the model timesteps, and\n",
    "released together in the routing loop."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "61cb5a77-a9ab-46ad-9e00-a0ae9732373e",
   "metadata": {},
