   "source": [
    "#### Definitions: schedule and location resolvers\n",
    "Two helpers translate the config above into what dorado needs. `build_daily_series`\n",
    "turns any schedule into a daily particles-per-day series; `resolve_seed_cells`\n",
    "turns any location into paired `(seed_xloc, seed_yloc)` grid-index lists (rows and\n",
    "columns), dropping cells that fall outside the wet domain."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "90c0f1fb-09be-4cda-bd11-b1646542b6bd",
   "metadata": {},
