    "### 5. Resolve Seed Cells and Region of Interest\n",
    "\n",
    "Now that the grid exists, we resolve every source's location into grid indices\n",
    "and plot them so you can confirm each release site lands where you expect. This\n",
    "is the step that lets you point the workflow at **any area you specify**."
   ]
  },
